			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"La somme demandée est $T_{{{eval:b}}}-T_{{{eval:a-1}}}$ : on retire les termes $1^3$, …, ${{eval:a-1}}^3$.",
					"$T_{{{eval:b}}}={{eval:(b*(b+1)/2)^2}}$ et $T_{{{eval:a-1}}}={{eval:((a-1)*a/2)^2}}$.",
					"Donc la somme vaut $\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:(b*(b+1)/2)^2-((a-1)*a/2)^2}}}$.",
					"Attention : on retire $T_{{{eval:a-1}}}$, pas $T_{{{eval:a}}}$."
